<p style="text-align: center;">Discovery Park. 11x14, oil on linen panel. 2016.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">This painting was done on the beach at Discovery Park in Magnolia. There's a really picturesque lighthouse there which I'll get around to painting some other time.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">By the time I started working the view across the sound was into the light and the sky was gray and cloudy. I decided to stick with a limited color structure and let the painting be about the light. In the end I managed to get most of what I was aiming for.</p>
